    LLM: 'Game: BÄƒi FÄ“n. Type: Point-Collection Trick-taking. Rules: 54 cards (1 deck + jokers). Points: 5=5, 10=10, K=10. Total 100. Attackers need 40. Rotating Trump Rank.',
    Player: 'Welcome to the Hundred Point Challenge. You and your partner are the Attackers. You need 40 points to take the lead. The trump rank is 2. Will you use your Red Joker to steal this King, or safe it for the final trick?',
